abstract: >
  A production-grade, multi-scenario analytics platform for regional economic
  comparison, retail site selection, sales forecasting and government
  industry-policy evaluation. Covers 10 major Chinese cities with 4 analysis
  scenarios, REST API and zero-build web UI. Built with FastAPI, pandas,
  scikit-learn, statsmodels, and ECharts.
